data: {"id": "02ea1ba3a0e547d6-final", "run_id": "02ea1ba3a0e547d6", "seq": 846, "ts_ms": 1788862257863, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod `workload` (aiops-case-v05) stuck in `ContainerCreating` / Pending phase |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确认挂载卷失败的确切原因（ConfigMap Key 缺失） |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | container.waiting_reason = ContainerCreating | 确认当前容器卡在启动前的挂载阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | pod.status = Pending, phase = Pending | 确认 Pod 处于等待资源就绪状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1 (reason: ContainerCreating) | 通过监控指标交叉验证了 Kubernetes 事件中的等待原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0 | 证明该容器尚未启动过，排除了因运行期资源不足导致重启的可能性 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n证据 1 提供了唯一的故障直接原因（ConfigMap 键不存在），证据 2、3 展示了由此引发的 Pod 状态结果（Pending/ContainerCreating）。证据 4 独立地从监控系统角度证实了处于 ContainerCreating 阶段的等待状态。证据 5 排除了应用逻辑或运行期崩溃因素。四个证据在因果链上逻辑闭环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nConfigMap 定义引用了不存在的 Key (`unavailable-key`) → Kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 失败 → 触发 FailedMount 事件，容器运行时无法初始化 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法对外提供服务\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因是 **ConfigMap 引用错误**（证据 1）。\nVolume `input` 指向的 ConfigMap 中并不存在指定的键 `unavailable-key`，导致 Kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时持续失败（证据 1）。该挂载失败直接阻塞了容器运行时的初始化流程，导致容器原因始终为 `ContainerCreating`（证据 2、4）且 Pod 状态保持为 `Pending`（证据 3）。由于容器从未启动，因此没有重启记录（证据 5）。现有事实确凿，无需额外排查其他维度。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 39.8s (Evidence 30.6s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 71.73, "metrics": {"run_id": "02ea1ba3a0e547d6", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 71.73691892623901, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 71736.91892623901, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 64808.589935302734, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 17412.721395492554, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6565.896034240723}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24236.021995544434, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "